# Only what the image needs: app/, static/, data/rules, the tag catalogue, the schema,
# the dependency lock, Paravent's licence (LICENSE) and the notices for what the image
# carries from others (NOTICE.md). User content and secrets never go into an image.
*
!pyproject.toml
!LICENSE
!NOTICE.md
!uv.lock
!app/
!static/
!data/rules/
!data/library/tags/5etools_tags.json
!documentation/character.schema.json
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.DS_Store
